{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 COLLECTION — THE DRAWN LIGHT-GLYPH PLATE (WINNING-SPEC §3.6.3, graft C3).

  Fifteen of the twenty-seven products have NO text-free photograph at any index 0–3. Every one is a
  marketing poster: a baked Hebrew headline, a spec icon strip, a cream or beige ground — and §6.10
  forbids cream on any surface, including a photograph's own ground. modern-led-bollard-light-5w-ip65
  is worse still: three conflicting third-party wordmarks (LUMIÈRE / LUMORA / LUMIRA) across four images.

  So for those fifteen the page does not crop, does not dim, and does not apologise. It DRAWS the lamp,
  in the same aspect and the same radius 0 as the photograph it replaces, and says so in the caption:

        איור · אין תצלום נקי

  It is NOT a grey placeholder and it NEVER says "coming soon" (§3.6.3). It is a [data-lamp] like any
  photograph — its warm halo is the thing that lights.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ call signatures
    once per page, before any plate (the <symbol> sprite + the stylesheet):
      {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-glyph', sprite: true %}

    one plate, in place of an <img>:
      {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-glyph', product: p, aspect: '1/1.15' %}
      {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-glyph', glyph: 'net', aspect: '1/.9', caption: 'איור · אין תצלום נקי' %}

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ inputs
    sprite  : true -> print ONLY the <symbol> sprite and the stylesheet. Call it ONCE per page, before
              any plate; a plate whose sprite is missing draws nothing, so this is not optional.
    product : the product the plate stands in for. Chooses the glyph from the shape ledger below and
              writes the alt text. Blank -> `glyph` must be given.
    glyph   : force one of the FIVE shape families — bollard | cube | string | net | spot.
              There are five and there will stay five; a sixth would be a new drawing style.
    aspect  : the aspect-ratio of the plate, matching the card or figure it replaces. Default '1/1.15'.
    caption : the plate caption. Default 'איור · אין תצלום נקי' (§3.6.3, verbatim). Pass '' for none —
              only ever inside a figure that has already said it.
    lamp    : 'off' to skip [data-lamp] (a plate inside an already-lit figure).
    class   : extra classes on the root.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ the shape ledger
    bollard — a post with a head: the path/bollard family
    cube    — a low box or a wall plate: step and deck lights, wall plates, lanterns
    string  — a cable carrying bulbs: the garlands
    net     — a mesh: decorative-led-net-lights, the one product sold by area
    spot    — an angled head on a bracket: spots, floodlights, security lights

  A product not in the ledger falls back on product.type, which maps 1:1 to the four collections, so a
  lamp the merchant adds tomorrow still gets a truthful shape with no file edit.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ what it prints
    <span class="env2-coll-glyph" data-glyph="bollard" data-lamp style="--env2-glyph-ar:1/1.15">
      <span class="env2-coll-glyph__halo"></span>       the warm --env2-ember radial, at 22%
      <svg class="env2-coll-glyph__art"><use href="#env2-glyph-bollard"></use></svg>
      <span class="env2-coll-glyph__cap">איור · אין תצלום נקי</span>
    </span>
  Ground #080d18, radius 0, stroke rgba(244,238,227,.45) at 1px, caption in the kicker style at the
  bottom start edge. No cream, no beige, no brown anywhere in it (§6.10).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_sprite = false
  if sprite == true
    assign env2_sprite = true
  endif
-%}
{%- unless env2_sprite -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_g = glyph | default: ''
  if env2_g == ''
    assign led = '|modern-led-bollard-light-5w-ip65=bollard|retro-solar-path-lights-set=bollard|modern-solar-path-lights-set=bollard|swaying-solar-path-lights-ip65=bollard|stainless-steel-solar-path-light-ip65=bollard|warm-solar-step-deck-lights=cube|waterproof-solar-deck-step-lights=cube|magnetic-rechargeable-touch-wall-light=cube|solar-wall-light-motion-sensor-ip65=cube|modern-led-wall-light-6w-up-down=cube|modern-led-wall-light-indoor-outdoor=cube|waterproof-led-wall-light-ip65-6w-12w=cube|outdoor-bidirectional-led-wall-light-ip65=cube|solar-garden-lantern-9-led=cube|rechargeable-telescopic-camping-lantern=cube|led-globe-string-lights=string|solar-rope-string-lights=string|solar-edison-string-lights=string|solar-crystal-ball-string-lights=string|solar-firefly-garden-lights=string|lighted-birch-branches-20-led=string|decorative-led-net-lights=net|solar-security-light-100-led=spot|solar-floodlight-ip67-remote-timer=spot|solar-garden-spotlight-52-led=spot|powerful-solar-garden-light=spot|dual-head-garden-light-10w-ip65=spot|'
    assign key = '|' | append: product.handle | append: '='
    assign hit = led | split: key
    if hit.size > 1
      assign env2_g = hit[1] | split: '|' | first
    endif
  endif
  if env2_g == ''
    assign t = product.type | default: ''
    if t == 'תאורת קיר'
      assign env2_g = 'cube'
    elsif t == 'גרילנדות ותאורה דקורטיבית'
      assign env2_g = 'string'
    elsif t == 'ספוטים, פרוז׳קטורים ותאורה ניידת'
      assign env2_g = 'spot'
    else
      assign env2_g = 'bollard'
    endif
  endif
  assign env2_ar = aspect | default: '1/1.15'
  assign env2_cap = 'איור · אין תצלום נקי'
  if caption != nil
    assign env2_cap = caption
  endif
  assign env2_alt = 'איור של המנורה — אין תצלום נקי'
  if product != blank
    assign env2_alt = product.title | append: ' — איור, אין תצלום נקי'
  endif
  assign env2_extra = class | default: ''
-%}
<span class="env2-coll-glyph{% if env2_extra != '' %} {{ env2_extra }}{% endif %}" data-glyph="{{ env2_g }}"{% unless lamp == 'off' %} data-lamp{% endunless %} style="--env2-glyph-ar:{{ env2_ar }}">
  <span class="env2-coll-glyph__halo" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <svg class="env2-coll-glyph__art" viewBox="0 0 120 140" role="img" aria-label="{{ env2_alt | escape }}" focusable="false"><use href="#env2-glyph-{{ env2_g }}"></use></svg>
  {%- if env2_cap != '' -%}<span class="env2-coll-glyph__cap">{{ env2_cap }}</span>{%- endif -%}
</span>
{%- endunless -%}
{%- if env2_sprite -%}
<svg class="env2-coll-glyph-sprite" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="0" height="0"><defs>
<symbol id="env2-glyph-bollard" viewBox="0 0 120 140">
  <path d="M44 34h32v10H44z"/><path d="M47 44v-6a13 13 0 0 1 26 0v6"/><path d="M60 44v70"/>
  <path d="M50 114h20"/><path d="M44 126h32"/><path d="M52 54h16M52 66h16M52 78h16"/>
</symbol>
<symbol id="env2-glyph-cube" viewBox="0 0 120 140">
  <path d="M34 52h52v40H34z"/><path d="M34 92l10 10h52l-10-10"/><path d="M86 52l10-10H44l-10 10"/>
  <path d="M46 64h28M46 76h28"/><path d="M60 102v14"/>
</symbol>
<symbol id="env2-glyph-string" viewBox="0 0 120 140">
  <path d="M8 44c20 26 36 26 52 0s32-26 52 0"/>
  <path d="M22 60v8M38 68v8M60 72v8M82 68v8M98 60v8"/>
  <circle cx="22" cy="74" r="6"/><circle cx="38" cy="82" r="6"/><circle cx="60" cy="86" r="6"/>
  <circle cx="82" cy="82" r="6"/><circle cx="98" cy="74" r="6"/>
</symbol>
<symbol id="env2-glyph-net" viewBox="0 0 120 140">
  <path d="M24 38h72v64H24z"/>
  <path d="M42 38v64M60 38v64M78 38v64M24 54h72M24 70h72M24 86h72"/>
  <circle cx="42" cy="54" r="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="70" r="3"/><circle cx="78" cy="86" r="3"/>
  <circle cx="78" cy="54" r="3"/><circle cx="42" cy="86" r="3"/>
</symbol>
<symbol id="env2-glyph-spot" viewBox="0 0 120 140">
  <path d="M36 40l44 18-10 24-44-18z"/><path d="M70 82l8 18"/><path d="M60 112h30"/>
  <path d="M75 100v12"/><path d="M84 30l14-8M96 46l16-2M88 60l14 8"/>
</symbol>
</defs></svg>
<style id="env2-coll-glyph-css">
/* ---------- the drawn plate (§3.6.3) — same aspect, same radius 0, as the photograph it replaces ---------- */
.env2-coll-glyph-sprite{position:absolute;inline-size:0;block-size:0;overflow:hidden}
.env2-coll-glyph{position:relative;display:block;inline-size:100%;
  aspect-ratio:var(--env2-glyph-ar,1/1.15);background:#080d18;border-radius:0;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}
/* the warm radial where the light source is — --env2-ember at 22 %. This is the thing that lights. */
.env2-coll-glyph__halo{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;display:block;
  background:radial-gradient(38% 34% at var(--env2-glyph-hx,50%) var(--env2-glyph-hy,32%),
    rgba(247,162,74,.22),rgba(247,162,74,0) 72%);
  opacity:var(--lit,1);transition:opacity 1.8s .2s;mix-blend-mode:screen}
.env2-coll-glyph__art{position:absolute;inset:0;inline-size:100%;block-size:100%;display:block;
  fill:none;stroke:rgba(244,238,227,.45);stroke-width:1;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;
  padding:16%;box-sizing:border-box;
  opacity:calc(.55 + .45*var(--lit,1));transition:opacity 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
.env2-coll-glyph[data-glyph="bollard"]{--env2-glyph-hx:50%;--env2-glyph-hy:26%}
.env2-coll-glyph[data-glyph="cube"]{--env2-glyph-hx:50%;--env2-glyph-hy:44%}
.env2-coll-glyph[data-glyph="string"]{--env2-glyph-hx:50%;--env2-glyph-hy:52%}
.env2-coll-glyph[data-glyph="net"]{--env2-glyph-hx:50%;--env2-glyph-hy:46%}
.env2-coll-glyph[data-glyph="spot"]{--env2-glyph-hx:38%;--env2-glyph-hy:40%}
/* the caption, in the kicker style, at the bottom START edge (§3.6.3) */
.env2-coll-glyph__cap{position:absolute;inset-block-end:12px;inset-inline-start:14px;
  font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;line-height:1.2;
  color:var(--env2-gold);pointer-events:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .env2-coll-glyph__halo,.env2-coll-glyph__art{transition:none}
}
</style>
{%- endif -%}
